      "name": "FIAP Videos",
      "description": "Full flow simulation for app-fiap-videos (local Docker stack).\n\nRun in order:\n1. Health checks\n2. Admin Login → copy accessToken into admin_access_token\n3. Register User (admin token required) OR use seeded demo user\n4. User Login → copy accessToken into access_token\n5. Upload video(s) → copy id into job_id\n6. Poll Get Job Status until status = completed\n7. Download ZIP\n\nWeb UI: http://localhost:3000/login | http://localhost:3000/status\n\nSide channels: RabbitMQ http://localhost:15673 (fiap/fiap), MailHog http://localhost:8025",
